# The ship's planet select (Rerac-vr's pointer.rs PlanetList, planet_select.rs): entered as the game enters
# it, QUEST_SIM_MENU=14 with QUEST_SIM_PLANETS=1,3,5,7 on its list. The hand down the list names each row
# and writes the ship's destination, which the game itself sets only as its keys move the list; on the
# galaxy map each planet is its row. The trigger on the last takes the game to its confirm page.
